{"id":"oreja","es":"oreja","en":["ear"],"pos":"noun","topic":"body","note":"f. The outside of the ear. oído is the inner ear and hearing.","sent":{"es":"Tiene un arete en la {oreja}.","en":"He has an earring in his ear."}}
{"id":"cuello","es":"cuello","en":["neck"],"pos":"noun","topic":"body","note":"m. Also a collar.","sent":{"es":"Me duele el {cuello}.","en":"My neck hurts."}}
{"id":"dedo","es":"dedo","en":["finger","toe"],"pos":"noun","topic":"body","note":"m. Spanish uses the one word for both.","sent":{"es":"Me corté el {dedo}.","en":"I cut my finger."}}
{"id":"estomago","es":"estómago","en":["stomach"],"pos":"noun","topic":"body","note":"m. dolor de estómago is a stomach ache.","sent":{"es":"Me duele el {estómago}.","en":"I have a stomach ache."}}
{"id":"piel","es":"piel","en":["skin"],"pos":"noun","topic":"body","note":"f.","sent":{"es":"Usa bloqueador, el sol quema la {piel}.","en":"Wear sun cream, the sun burns your skin."}}
{"id":"sangre","es":"sangre","en":["blood"],"pos":"noun","topic":"body","note":"f.","sent":{"es":"No me gusta ver {sangre}.","en":"I do not like seeing blood."}}
{"id":"rodilla","es":"rodilla","en":["knee"],"pos":"noun","topic":"body","note":"f.","sent":{"es":"Me lastimé la {rodilla} escalando.","en":"I hurt my knee climbing."}}
{"id":"hombro","es":"hombro","en":["shoulder"],"pos":"noun","topic":"body","note":"m.","sent":{"es":"Tengo el {hombro} rígido.","en":"My shoulder is stiff."}}
{"id":"garganta","es":"garganta","en":["throat"],"pos":"noun","topic":"body","note":"f. dolor de garganta is a sore throat.","sent":{"es":"Me duele la {garganta}.","en":"I have a sore throat."}}
{"id":"fiebre","es":"fiebre","en":["fever","temperature"],"pos":"noun","topic":"body","note":"f. tener fiebre, to have a temperature.","sent":{"es":"Tengo {fiebre}.","en":"I have a temperature."}}
{"id":"gripa","es":"gripa","en":["flu"],"pos":"noun","topic":"body","note":"f. Colombian. Spain says gripe. Covers a bad cold as well.","sent":{"es":"Creo que tengo {gripa}.","en":"I think I have a cold."}}
